<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 27 April <span class="n">5</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/philip-the-bold"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/philip-the-bold.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Philip the Bold</span><span class="tp">1342–1404</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-magellan"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ferdinand-magellan.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ferdinand Magellan</span><span class="tp">c. 1480–1521</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/maeda-toshiie"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/maeda-toshiie.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Maeda Toshiie</span><span class="tp">1538–1599</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/henry-parkes"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/henry-parkes.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Henry Parkes</span><span class="tp">1815–1896</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/rene-barrientos"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/rene-barrientos.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">René Barrientos</span><span class="tp">1919–1969</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
